                      '        """Keep an implicit ``<tool_call>`` boundary in '
                      'generated content.\n'
                      '\n'
                      '        The structured-output scheduler must skip unconstrained '
                      'reasoning\n'
                      '        tokens, but it must advance the Qwen XML grammar with '
                      '``<tool_call>``\n'
